{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kalliopi\u2019s past remains shrouded in mystery. What is known is that her tribe fell to the relentless conquest of Guljin, leaving her a prisoner of the Khatun. But Kalliopi\u2019s story didn\u2019t end in chains\u2014it began anew. Faced with impossible odds, Kalliopi rose to the challenge. Her unmatched skill, unyielding determination, and magnetic presence have made her the star of Guljin\u2019s bloody spectacles. To Kalliopi, the arena is no longer a cage; it is her kingdom. She has embraced her role fully, wielding her growing fame as both armor and purpose in a life reshaped by the Khatun\u2019s victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hero Skin of Queen Kalliopi offer includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Gladiator Hero Skin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7-Day Champion Status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Scavenger Crates</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534380?t=1741871442","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534380?t=1741871442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534380/33a7c1c57caccdf3c52b63e077792154ddd42981/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741871442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534380/33a7c1c57caccdf3c52b63e077792154ddd42981/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741871442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra